      <data key="e_edge_type">comment</data>
      <data key="e_vosonTxt_comment">Wow, that song is just right for me. I never get sick of this one for sure. It&apos;s my favorite one in the world center for like a long time. When you got problems, it doesn&apos;t matter. It&apos;s always make you feel good about this song. Because he said, you look perfect tonight. And that&apos;s means a lot when they say something like that. I lost me before that. And they said, I look beautiful at perfect tonight, and now we just woke up. But we never went out. It&apos;s like good friends and fall in love with me. But not him, and since I lost the weight, he told me the first time last night I was looking perfect tonight. But now, tonight, I&apos;m my by myself, because we&apos;re not together. Just like That for that love is sharing.I love him so much, and he got the perfect voice and the life story.And he&apos;s not afraid to talk about himself, because he&apos;s a man who sings song that he cares all about his family.That&apos;s what count in life of a love, not when you, you know, you say you love.But it&apos;s not love you change love.But it&apos;s not love.My sister&apos;s real just find out.But now i&apos;m going no love.But I give it my heart, but it&apos;s okay, because you know why?Because I put, i&apos;m a I went.I turn around when I turn around.I&apos;m not looking back in.You have to be like that.Sometimes, in life anyway, I love is sharing okay.I&apos;m gonna start listening to him</data>
