    <edge source="n418" target="n883">
      <data key="e_video_id">2Vv-BfVoq4g</data>
      <data key="e_comment_id">UgxIMgfB69hQgB24dBx4AaABAg</data>
      <data key="e_edge_type">comment</data>
      <data key="e_vosonTxt_comment">“Today is her birthday… and I feel so unlucky that I can’t even wish her. She hates me so much now that she doesn’t even want to see my face. Even though my love was one-sided, the pain feels so real that it hurts deep inside, even physically. This song will be always our favorite…it reminds me her reminds  every single moment  what we shared like playing tt singing together it feels like the only bridge that still connects us. I can’t send her my feelings anymore, so I’m writing them here with the hope that somehow, someday, she will read this. All I truly wish is for her happiness
Happy Birthday, Pingu 
I wish you the happiest birthday, my love. I hope you’re enjoying your day surrounded by the people who love you.
I know I hurt you, and I completely deserve your anger and your hate. I understand that you don’t want to talk to me or even see my face, and I promise I won’t call or message you I don’t want to ruin your special day. I know I might have another panic attack, but I deserve every bit of pain for what I did.
Most importantly, I want you to stay happy, keep growing, and stay focused on your career. Become the successful, amazing woman you are meant to be. And please, never stop smiling your smile is the only thing I ever cherished.
Once again, happy birthday, my cute little penguin 🐧💖 My only love, my world, my everything. Just remember, there’s an idiot who will always love you, no matter what, in every situation.
Wishing you all the happiness in the world today and always, my love</data>
      <data key="e_screen_name">@astrophysiciso</data>
      <data key="e_at_id">NA</data>
    </edge>
